RESET YOUR PASSWORD

Hi Ada,

Someone requested a password reset for your account. Use the button below to choose a new password.

Reset password https://app.resq.software/reset?token=reset-abc

Or paste this link into your browser:
https://app.resq.software/reset?token=reset-abc

This link expires in 30 minutes.

If you didn't request this, your password is unchanged and you can ignore this email. If you're concerned about unauthorized access, reset your password to secure your account.

----------------------------------------

You're receiving this email because a password reset was requested for your account.

ResQ Systems, Inc., 131 Continental Dr, Suite 305, Newark, DE 19713, USA

Terms https://resq.software/legal/terms · Privacy https://resq.software/legal/privacy"
